  {
    "id": "anno-nihonmatsu_upper_p044_right-01",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "〔頭書〕租稅帳辰年燒失ニ而五年平均ナリカタクシカシ非常ノ／水旱等ノ節ハ格別定免ニ付五ヶ年平均セスモ大同小異ノヨシ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "〔頭書〕租税帳は辰年に焼失にて、五年平均なりかたく。しかし非常の水旱等の節は格別定免に付き、五ヶ年平均せずも大同小異のよし"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Head-note (two-column warichu, right column first): the tax ledgers burned in the Year of the Dragon, so a five-year average cannot be struck; but since a special fixed remission applies in times of exceptional flood or drought, the figures are much the same even without a five-year average. Two cursive kana in this note are uncertain: the connector after 燒失ニ (read here as 而) and the kana after 平均セス (read here as モ)."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "頭書"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p044_right.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2006,1277,150,1876"
      }
    }
  },
